The command exited with status 1 due to a failed assertion in the script.

The script's assertion checked that a placement endpoint (`http://127.0.0.1:8000/control/replicas`) returns exactly 2 replicas, each with no group fault, no active requests, not draining, and calibrated work ranking. The assertion failed (`AssertionError`), meaning at least one of those conditions was not met — for example, not exactly 2 replicas returned, or one of them is faulted/draining/has active requests/not calibrated.
